"type":"text"},{"text":"current system’s old name, not a format. Editions on the legacy replica","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"system open only in the prebuilt UI. To check which system a title is on,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Edition-Platforms#Telling-Which-System-a-Publication-Is-On"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Prebuilt UI","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Custom UI","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You write"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configuration and delegates, plus your own navigation if you place screens yourself"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every screen: archive, reader chrome, page browser, settings"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Archive, bookmarks, downloads, and search screens"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Prebuilt"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Yours","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reader screen (navigation bar, content browser, loading screen, settings)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Prebuilt"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yours, around the SDK’s page renderer"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Features such as sharing, paywalls, and text-to-speech","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Built in: you switch them on and connect delegates"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You build each one, from SDK parts where they exist","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Customization"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Theming, configuration, delegates","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Anything"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Analytics"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Ready-made events","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your own, from the reader’s delegates","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Classic PDF and responsive editions","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Editions on the legacy replica system"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No"}]}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose the prebuilt UI when its screens, themed to your brand, fit your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app: it’s the least code, and features arrive as configuration. Choose a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"custom UI when your design needs a reader screen of its own. The choice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"isn’t all or nothing; see "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Choosing-an-Integration#Mixing-Prebuilt-and-Custom-UI","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"The Prebuilt UI","level":2,"anchor":"The-Prebuilt-UI","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The prebuilt UI gives you archives, the reader screen, offline downloads,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bookmarks, search, and analytics events, all themed from one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/GlobalConfiguration"},{"type":"text","text":". Delegates connect your paywall, sharing,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"text-to-speech, commenting, adverts, and media. You can show it whole, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"place its screens one at a time in your own navigation."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Whole, as the carousel.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/CarouselViewController","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a complete"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader app in one view controller. Give it a shortcode and it loads your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"publications, their archives, and their reader settings from PageSuite:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let globalConfig = GlobalConfiguration(apiKey: \"API_KEY\", accountGUID: \"ACCOUNT_GUID\")","","let carousel = CarouselViewController(","    globalConfig: globalConfig,","    sections: [","        .dynamicArchive(\"Editions\", shortcode: \"SHORTCODE\"),","        .subsections(\"My Content\", [","            .init(name: \"Bookmarks\", type: .bookmarks(type: .all)),","            .init(name: \"Downloads\", type: .downloads(type: .all))","        ])","    ]",")"],"copyToClipboard":true,"wrap":0,"type":"codeListing","lineAnnotations":[],"syntax":"swift","showLineNumbers":false},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Setting-Up-the-Carousel","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Screen by screen, in your own navigation.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Each screen the carousel"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shows is also a view controller you can place yourself:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ArchiveViewController"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksViewController"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/DownloadsViewController"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/SearchViewController","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedReaderViewController","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" opens one edition in the prebuilt reader"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"screen from anywhere, such as a button, a notification, or your own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"archive list:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","lineAnnotations":[],"code":["\/\/ An archive screen inside your own navigation.","let archive = ArchiveViewController(","    globalConfig: globalConfig,","    archiveType: .feedArchive(guid: \"PUBLICATION_GUID\", publicationName: \"The Daily\")",")","navigationController?.pushViewController(archive, animated: true)","","\/\/ The latest edition, straight from a button.","let reader = FeedReaderViewController(","    globalConfig: globalConfig,","    latestEditionForPublication: \"PUBLICATION_GUID\"",")","reader.modalPresentationStyle = .fullScreen","present(reader, animated: true)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Embedding-Prebuilt-Screens","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Presenting-the-Prebuilt-Reader","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Every screen takes the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"configuration and delegates as the carousel, so you can start with one"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and move to the other.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"What it costs:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" the layout is the SDK’s. You can restyle and configure","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every screen, but not rearrange it, and the reader screen is always the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SDK’s.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Editions on the legacy replica system open from the carousel and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prebuilt screens, but not from "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedReaderViewController","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", which opens editions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on the current system only."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Continue with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Prebuilt-UI"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"A Custom UI","anchor":"A-Custom-UI","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A custom UI is built on the core SDK, the engine the prebuilt UI runs on.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You fetch the catalog with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedEditionService","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", open an edition, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"host ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEditionReaderViewController","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", which renders pages and nothing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"else, inside a screen you design:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"copyToClipboard":true,"wrap":0,"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","lineAnnotations":[],"code":["import PSReader","import UIKit","","final class LatestEditionViewController: UIViewController {","","    private let reader = PSEditionReaderViewController()","","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","","        \/\/ Host the reader as a child; your chrome goes around it.","        addChild(reader)","        reader.view.frame = view.bounds","        reader.view.autoresizingMask = [.flexibleWidth, .flexibleHeight]","        view.addSubview(reader.view)","        reader.didMove(toParent: self)","","        Task {","            do {","                let service = FeedEditionService(accountGUID: \"ACCOUNT_GUID\")","                let published = try await service.latestEdition(publicationGUID: \"PUBLICATION_GUID\")","                let source = try await published.openEditionSource()","                reader.open(edition: source)","            } catch {","                \/\/ Show your own error state.","            }","        }","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What you get:"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" full control. The archive, navigation bar, page","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"browser, loading screen, and settings are yours. The SDK reports the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state they need: paging through the reader’s delegates, download progress"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEDownloadObserver","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and bookmark changes through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEBookmarkObserver","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEDownloadManager","isActive":true},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEBookmarkManager","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"handle offline reading and bookmarks.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What it costs:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" more code. There’s no configuration to theme,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"because every pixel outside the pages is yours, and you build each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"feature the prebuilt reader would have given you. Analytics come from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader’s delegates; of the prebuilt UI’s ready-made events, only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"downloads and bookmarks still arrive."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Continue with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Custom-UI","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", which lists what you build and what the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SDK provides for each part. Moving from the legacy core SDK? Start with"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifie